\`\`\`
## This Environment
- Preset: \`hosted-organization-team\` (version 1).
- Name: \`workspace\` (workspace-vm).
- Owner: Organization \`example\`, Team \`sample-team\`.
- Assignment: shared by the Team.
- Operator: whichever Team member is connected now. The OS account is shared by the Team and is not a person. On GitHub you act as the brokered Organization identity, not as that person, and changes are attributed to the Team.
- Tailnet: Headscale node \`example-workspace\`.
